Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:17.03,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,Are you awake?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.28,0:00:24.92,Default,T,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.26,0:00:27.99,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,I'm a doctor from Chiba.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.99,0:00:29.47,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,My name is Date.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.30,0:00:31.13,Default,T,0,0,0,,A doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.18,0:00:33.65,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,It's only a quick fix,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.65,0:00:35.85,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,but with some rest, the bleeding should stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.85,0:00:37.75,Default,T,0,0,0,,R-Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.26,0:00:40.56,Default,T,0,0,0,,I thought I was done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.56,0:00:43.11,Default,T,0,0,0,,I thought I'd never see my wife and son again.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.52,0:00:48.24,Default,T,0,0,0,,Dr. Date, thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.24,0:00:49.49,Default,T,0,0,0,,Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.36,0:00:52.91,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,It's my duty as a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.91,0:00:55.28,Default,Doc,0,0,0,,Now, stay here and rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.28,0:00:58.04,Default,T,0,0,0,,Thank you! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.60,0:01:00.66,Italics,D,0,0,0,,Fool.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:04.89,Italics,D,0,0,0,,I saved you so I'd be able to use you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.24,0:01:09.75,Italics,D,0,0,0,,Why the hell did I have to be dragged back here, anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.67,0:01:13.23,Italics,D,0,0,0,,To hell with this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.23,0:01:15.49,Default,S,0,0,0,,Wh-Who are you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.93,0:01:20.72,Default,T,0,0,0,,S-Sakamoto, you came back?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:22.83,Default,S,0,0,0,,Of course I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.44,0:01:25.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,What are you doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.65,0:01:27.27,Default,S,0,0,0,,Get away from him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.28,0:01:31.33,Italics,D,0,0,0,,So he had friends with him?
