Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.74,0:03:04.54,Default,D,0,0,0,,I-It's not like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.54,0:03:06.50,Default,D,0,0,0,,Please don't misunderstand.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:08.54,Default,D,0,0,0,,I just happened to be passing by.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.54,0:03:10.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw he was hurt, so I treated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.39,0:03:15.33,Default,D,0,0,0,,I'm a doctor, so saving lives is my job.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.33,0:03:18.10,Default,D,0,0,0,,I've no intention of taking part in this barbaric game!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.01,0:03:21.18,Default,S,0,0,0,,A doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.18,0:03:26.26,Default,T,0,0,0,,S-Sakamoto, he saved my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.26,0:03:28.82,Default,T,0,0,0,,He's a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.82,0:03:30.70,Default,T,0,0,0,,You can trust him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.70,0:03:32.38,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Nice work, cripple.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.37,0:03:36.66,Default,H,0,0,0,,It looks professionally done.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.66,0:03:38.97,Default,H,0,0,0,,He may really be a doctor.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.97,0:03:40.33,Default,S,0,0,0,,O-Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.33,0:03:42.67,Italics,D,0,0,0,,Stupid school girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.67,0:03:44.21,Italics,D,0,0,0,,What do you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.83,0:03:48.36,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.36,0:03:49.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,I was just surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.72,0:03:52.32,Default,D,0,0,0,,No, as long as we're clear, it's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.32,0:03:54.59,Default,D,0,0,0,,I understand completely.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.01,0:03:57.10,Default,S,0,0,0,,However, there is one thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.17,0:04:00.35,Default,S,0,0,0,,Would you show me your BIMs?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.71,0:04:05.38,Default,S,0,0,0,,That will tell me whether you're playing the game or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.05,0:04:08.48,Default,S,0,0,0,,Of course. That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.29,0:04:13.82,Default,H,0,0,0,,I've never seen this type on the island.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.35,0:04:15.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,Remote controlled.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.82,0:04:20.28,Default,S,0,0,0,,You trigger the switch on the BIM and then use this remote control to activate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.28,0:04:22.58,Default,S,0,0,0,,They're used for traps.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.07,0:04:25.20,Default,H,0,0,0,,I used to fall for those all the time!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.20,0:04:27.43,Default,S,0,0,0,,Because you just rush forward.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:27.43,0:04:30.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,Anyone who gets hit with traps isn't paying enough attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.15,0:04:32.26,Default,H,0,0,0,,What's that supposed mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.26,0:04:37.10,Overlap,H,0,0,0,,If you ask me, people who are good with traps are just jerks.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.21,0:04:36.00,Italics,D,0,0,0,,What? These guys are gamers?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.00,0:04:38.36,Italics,D,0,0,0,,They're just wasting their lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.36,0:04:39.97,Default,S,0,0,0,,U-Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.55,0:04:43.48,Default,S,0,0,0,,There isn't any sign you've ever used your BIMs.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.48,0:04:45.44,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm sorry I doubted you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.44,0:04:46.73,Default,D,0,0,0,,Not at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.25,0:04:51.15,Italics,D,0,0,0,,Good thing I didn't run into anyone these last three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.15,0:04:53.23,Default,S,0,0,0,,If you wouldn't mind,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.03,0:04:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,would you help us try to escape this island together?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.42,0:04:59.62,Default,D,0,0,0,,Escape the island together?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.62,0:05:00.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:06.25,Default,S,0,0,0,,We'll get eight chips, call in the helicopter, then steal it and run.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.83,0:05:08.20,Default,D,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.20,0:05:11.75,Italics,D,0,0,0,,Come on, you really think it's that easy?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.75,0:05:14.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,We currently have three chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.05,0:05:17.54,Italics,D,0,0,0,,Three?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.54,0:05:19.68,Default,D,0,0,0,,You already have three?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.68,0:05:20.89,Default,S,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.89,0:05:24.07,Default,D,0,0,0,,P-Please allow me to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:25.78,Default,D,0,0,0,,We'll all survive together.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.78,0:05:27.94,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'll be counting on your help, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.81,0:05:31.87,Default,D,0,0,0,,I'm Date Masahito.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.87,0:05:33.57,Default,S,0,0,0,,I'm Sakamoto Ryouta.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.13,0:05:35.95,Default,S,0,0,0,,Her name is Himiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.95,0:05:38.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,The man you treated is Mr. Taira.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.71,0:05:40.82,Default,D,0,0,0,,Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.85,0:05:47.46,Italics,H,0,0,0,,He was abandoned here because someone hated him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.49,0:05:55.82,Default,S,0,0,0,,A carrier!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.82,0:05:58.41,Default,S,0,0,0,,They're going to start dropping supplies again?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.41,0:06:00.92,Default,D,0,0,0,,Sakamoto, let's go get them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.92,0:06:04.34,Default,D,0,0,0,,If we all work together, we'll have a better chance of getting them.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.34,0:06:05.43,Default,S,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.91,0:06:08.89,Default,S,0,0,0,,Mr. Taira, we're going to get food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.89,0:06:11.23,Default,T,0,0,0,,Y-You're leaving again?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.23,0:06:13.30,Default,S,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.30,0:06:16.13,Default,S,0,0,0,,We'll come back with some delicious food.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.13,0:06:17.84,Default,S,0,0,0,,Look forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.07,0:06:22.48,Italics,D,0,0,0,,With these three here, that makes six chips.
