Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.21,0:06:38.76,Default,S,0,0,0,,One's landing nearby.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.79,0:06:41.64,Default,S,0,0,0,,The wind's strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.64,0:06:43.01,Default,H,0,0,0,,It's getting blown away!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.11,0:06:46.74,Default,D,0,0,0,,It's heading for the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:48.12,Default,S,0,0,0,,Don't give up.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.12,0:06:49.52,Default,S,0,0,0,,We have to get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.69,0:06:53.88,Default,S,0,0,0,,Radar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.88,0:06:55.92,Default,S,0,0,0,,Someone else is after the food.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.85,0:07:03.52,Default,S,0,0,0,,There are six of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.52,0:07:05.86,Default,D,0,0,0,,What do we do? Turn back?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.86,0:07:07.28,Default,S,0,0,0,,We don't need to turn back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.83,0:07:11.04,Default,S,0,0,0,,If we just show them we're getting it, no matter what,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.04,0:07:13.32,Default,S,0,0,0,,we can scare them off.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.95,0:07:21.97,Default,D,0,0,0,,Everyone's watching each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.81,0:07:24.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,Two are getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.03,0:07:27.10,Default,S,0,0,0,,Two gave up and left.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.65,0:07:30.72,Default,S,0,0,0,,Two seem to just be watching.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.85,0:07:33.04,Default,D,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.04,0:07:35.15,Default,D,0,0,0,,It's heading toward the two who are getting closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.57,0:07:38.48,Default,S,0,0,0,,We have to show them our intent...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.48,0:07:40.07,Default,S,0,0,0,,Show them we won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.91,0:07:43.07,Default,S,0,0,0,,Just a little futher, then we'll catch—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.07,0:07:43.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.03,0:07:49.03,Italics,S,0,0,0,,He isn't backing off?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.81,0:07:52.26,Italics,S,0,0,0,,It's risky to use BIMs here.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.51,0:07:56.60,Italics,S,0,0,0,,The first to leave the forest will be an easy target.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.11,0:07:59.38,Italics,S,0,0,0,,But if I'm too slow, he'll take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.38,0:08:01.52,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.73,0:08:18.27,Italics,S,0,0,0,,This guy...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.05,0:08:21.53,Italics,S,0,0,0,,He's not backing off one bit?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.11,0:08:23.46,Italics,S,0,0,0,,What's he thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.47,0:08:26.28,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Wait...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.85,0:08:28.03,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Those sunglasses...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.38,0:08:29.41,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I've seen him before!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.71,0:08:38.10,Default,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.10,0:08:39.21,Default,?,0,0,0,,Oda!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.68,0:08:54.72,Default,?,0,0,0,,You die, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.45,0:09:27.88,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Where is he? Where's that guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.17,0:09:33.76,Default,D,0,0,0,,Okay, got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.23,0:09:38.28,Default,D,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.28,0:09:39.52,Default,D,0,0,0,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.52,0:09:41.10,Default,D,0,0,0,,I can't release the parachute.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.33,0:09:51.97,Italics,D,0,0,0,,A corrosive gas type!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.97,0:09:53.41,Italics,D,0,0,0,,The wind will spread the gas.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.73,0:09:55.54,Default,D,0,0,0,,Mr. Date! Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.93,0:09:57.36,Default,D,0,0,0,,Forget the trunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.36,0:09:59.00,Default,D,0,0,0,,Get away from that smoke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.81,0:10:08.90,Italics,D,0,0,0,,I'll leave the food to you, Sakamoto.{TLC}
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.30,0:10:15.42,Default,D,0,0,0,,There it is, Sakamoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.42,0:10:16.06,Default,D,0,0,0,,Take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.45,0:10:16.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Wha—
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.51,0:10:33.57,Default,S,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.91,0:10:35.53,Default,D,0,0,0,,Nice catch, Sakamoto!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.69,0:10:42.72,Default,D,0,0,0,,Run!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.72,0:10:44.13,Default,D,0,0,0,,Don't let him get the trunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.89,0:10:46.11,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Of course not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.11,0:10:48.38,Italics,S,0,0,0,,After all of this, no way I'm letting him take it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.26,0:10:56.44,Default,?,0,0,0,,I did well to kill her,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.44,0:10:59.20,Default,?,0,0,0,,but I don't want to go get her chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.20,0:11:01.07,Default,?,0,0,0,,It's gross.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.07,0:11:02.42,Default,?,0,0,0,,Whatever.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:02.42,0:11:05.88,Default,?,0,0,0,,When Oda gets back, I'll get him to take the chip and BIMs from...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.79,0:11:13.12,Default,?,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.12,0:11:14.82,Default,?,0,0,0,,You're alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.82,0:11:16.00,Default,H,0,0,0,,It's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.00,0:11:19.12,Default,H,0,0,0,,I panicked and tossed that BIM away,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.12,0:11:21.87,Default,H,0,0,0,,but I should have thrown it back at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.59,0:11:30.13,Default,H,0,0,0,,You only have timer BIMs, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.71,0:11:34.38,Default,?,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.11,0:11:38.22,Default,H,0,0,0,,Mine are crackers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.22,0:11:41.39,Default,H,0,0,0,,Head-to-head, I have the advantage.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.10,0:11:47.18,Default,?,0,0,0,,But at this range, neither of us will make it out unscathed if we use BIMs.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.18,0:11:49.78,Default,H,0,0,0,,But I have this.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.46,0:11:53.04,Default,?,0,0,0,,And? So what?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.04,0:11:55.02,Default,?,0,0,0,,You won't let me get away?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.02,0:11:57.38,Default,?,0,0,0,,You and your stupid stun gun...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.38,0:11:58.86,Default,?,0,0,0,,I've seen your type before,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.86,0:12:03.62,Default,?,0,0,0,,ugly girls who carry all kinds of ridiculous crap for "self-defense."
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.62,0:12:07.67,Default,?,0,0,0,,Did you think showing me would make me turn tail and run?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.03,0:12:10.42,Default,?,0,0,0,,Okay, bring it on.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.42,0:12:12.92,Default,?,0,0,0,,I'll beat the crap out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.37,0:12:24.50,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.17,0:12:33.30,Italics,S,0,0,0,,These flames...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.30,0:12:34.64,Italics,S,0,0,0,,A flame type bomb?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.64,0:12:35.94,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Another hostile player?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.94,0:12:38.03,Default,S,0,0,0,,Damn, I'm totally surrounded!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.37,0:12:47.54,Default,Eyeballdude,0,0,0,,Now he can't escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.54,0:12:49.58,Default,Eyeballdude,0,0,0,,We'll just watch him burn to ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.41,0:12:53.63,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,That won't do. You have to finish him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.63,0:12:54.70,Default,Ebd,0,0,0,,Shut it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.70,0:12:56.20,Default,Ebd,0,0,0,,No one asked your opinion, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.20,0:12:57.51,Default,Ebd,0,0,0,,Just shut up and watch!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.01,0:13:01.01,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,But you know, this won't go well.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.27,0:13:09.90,Default,Oda,0,0,0,,I'm taking this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.03,0:13:18.65,Default,S,0,0,0,,You've gotta be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.45,0:13:29.32,Default,Ebd,0,0,0,,That bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.85,0:13:32.48,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Isn't there a beach up that way?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.27,0:13:34.71,Default,Ebd,0,0,0,,What of it?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.53,0:13:39.28,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,That's probably where they'll try to come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.28,0:13:41.90,Default,Ebd,0,0,0,,I-I know that!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.90,0:13:44.14,Default,Ebd,0,0,0,,You don't have to tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.14,0:13:45.08,Default,Ebd,0,0,0,,I'm going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.08,0:13:45.97,Default,Ebd,0,0,0,,Don't get in my way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.09,0:13:52.98,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,No, I won't get in your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.47,0:13:57.04,Default,Kid,0,0,0,,Since I'm already so sick of you stupid adults.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.03,0:14:02.52,Default,?,0,0,0,,What's this? You're shaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.52,0:14:04.49,Default,?,0,0,0,,You're scared, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.03,0:14:07.66,Default,?,0,0,0,,If you need to carry that thing, I guess you must be.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.01,0:14:11.50,Default,?,0,0,0,,I bet you're a neat freak, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.50,0:14:14.84,Default,?,0,0,0,,Had a bad experience before you lost your virginity?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.84,0:14:16.25,Default,H,0,0,0,,Shut up! That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.25,0:14:20.00,Default,?,0,0,0,,Your shouting makes me oh so suspicious.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.00,0:14:21.62,Default,?,0,0,0,,Does that mean I was right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.05,0:14:27.12,Default,?,0,0,0,,You're carrying that around because you can't trust anyone?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.12,0:14:28.96,Default,?,0,0,0,,It's proof that you have a weak heart.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.96,0:14:29.78,Default,H,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.78,0:14:31.02,Default,H,0,0,0,,You're wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.95,0:14:44.30,Default,?,0,0,0,,You're a stupid brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.30,0:14:46.20,Default,?,0,0,0,,Maybe I'll strangle you right here.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.03,0:14:49.38,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Wh-Who is this woman?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.91,0:14:51.16,Italics,H,0,0,0,,She isn't normal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.43,0:14:57.40,Default,?,0,0,0,,Your stun gun can't help you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.40,0:15:01.22,Default,?,0,0,0,,A strong body is the important thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.13,0:15:05.10,Default,?,0,0,0,,You're tougher than you look.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.10,0:15:07.60,Default,?,0,0,0,,Just give in already.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.11,0:15:10.34,Italics,H,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.34,0:15:13.61,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Why am I trying to survive?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.61,0:15:15.62,Italics,H,0,0,0,,I tried to die so many times.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.27,0:15:17.61,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.61,0:15:21.02,Italics,H,0,0,0,,N-No...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.83,0:15:22.86,Italics,H,0,0,0,,That's not...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.81,0:15:26.10,Italics,H,0,0,0,,I don't feel that way about him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.91,0:15:28.02,Italics,H,0,0,0,,I just can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.52,0:15:30.44,Italics,H,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.27,0:15:34.83,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Right now, whatever the reason, I don't want to die!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.59,0:15:39.50,Default,?,0,0,0,,Stop struggling already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.45,0:15:43.59,Italics,H,0,0,0,,I won't give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.53,0:15:46.93,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I want to stay with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.27,0:15:49.46,Italics,H,0,0,0,,It's not like that!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.51,0:16:01.34,Default,?,0,0,0,,How dare you, you ugly bitch?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.34,0:16:03.03,Default,?,0,0,0,,Enough of your shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.03,0:16:07.58,Default,?,0,0,0,,That hurt!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.58,0:16:10.03,Default,?,0,0,0,,What the hell was that for?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.81,0:16:12.45,Default,H,0,0,0,,You're still standing?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.45,0:16:15.04,Italics,H,0,0,0,,The voltage is dropping!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.04,0:16:15.62,Default,?,0,0,0,,How dare you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.43,0:16:21.88,Default,?,0,0,0,,Come on and die, already!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.88,0:16:29.98,Default,?,0,0,0,,Wh-What is that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.57,0:16:46.45,Italics,?,0,0,0,,Who's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.45,0:16:47.84,Italics,?,0,0,0,,Is he with that girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.09,0:17:02.54,Italics,D,0,0,0,,She's still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.25,0:17:07.54,Default,D,0,0,0,,Are you okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.54,0:17:09.22,Default,D,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.22,0:17:10.34,Default,D,0,0,0,,Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.73,0:17:14.80,Default,H,0,0,0,,N-No.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.80,0:17:17.10,Italics,H,0,0,0,,That almost killed me, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.47,0:17:18.62,Default,D,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:20.98,Default,D,0,0,0,,I'm glad you weren't badly hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.98,0:17:23.36,Default,D,0,0,0,,If I hadn't come by, it could've been bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.05,0:17:27.92,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Wh-What is he talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.92,0:17:32.12,Italics,H,0,0,0,,He tried to kill us both, but he's acting as if he saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.69,0:17:35.34,Italics,H,0,0,0,,I can't trust him at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.25,0:17:41.66,Italics,H,0,0,0,,But if I say that out loud, he might kill me on the spot.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.37,0:17:48.38,Default,H,0,0,0,,Th-Thank you for saving me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.43,0:17:52.72,Default,D,0,0,0,,Can you walk?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.72,0:17:55.44,Default,D,0,0,0,,Let's go look for Sakamoto.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:55.44,0:17:56.96,Default,,0,0,0,,R-Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.59,0:17:59.38,Italics,H,0,0,0,,This place is filled with enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.05,0:18:03.74,Italics,H,0,0,0,,The only person I can trust is Ryouta.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.23,0:18:07.92,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Ryouta, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.75,0:18:09.98,Italics,H,0,0,0,,Don't die!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.39,0:18:22.67,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.15,0:18:24.54,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Did he run away?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.43,0:18:27.56,Italics,S,0,0,0,,No, he's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.56,0:18:29.64,Italics,S,0,0,0,,He's waiting to ambush me somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.95,0:18:35.35,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That isn't him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.83,0:18:38.26,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Is he the one who used those flame types?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.03,0:18:46.47,Default,Ebd,0,0,0,,Hey, there's no one here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.47,0:18:49.06,Default,Ebd,0,0,0,,That kid was full of crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.27,0:18:55.52,Italics,Ebd,0,0,0,,Wh-What's that doing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.23,0:19:02.12,Italics,Ebd,0,0,0,,One of them must've hidden it there so that the other wouldn't take it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.63,0:19:04.28,Italics,Ebd,0,0,0,,What idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:08.24,Italics,Ebd,0,0,0,,They were so focused on each other that, in the end,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.71,0:19:11.32,Italics,Ebd,0,0,0,,they let me walk off with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.70,0:19:35.57,Default,S,0,0,0,,Don't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.19,0:19:39.37,Default,S,0,0,0,,Move an inch, and I'll shove this cracker up your ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.57,0:19:42.46,Default,S,0,0,0,,Drop all your BIMs...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.46,0:19:44.37,Default,S,0,0,0,,the trunk, the chips— all of it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.73,0:20:07.96,Default,S,0,0,0,,Now put your hands on your head.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.57,0:20:12.60,Italics,S,0,0,0,,He's being too obedient.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.57,0:20:14.98,Default,O,0,0,0,,You got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.98,0:20:16.68,Default,O,0,0,0,,I surrender.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.68,0:20:18.95,Default,O,0,0,0,,How about coming over and getting 'em?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.91,0:20:20.94,Default,O,0,0,0,,Are you scared?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.45,0:20:23.44,Default,O,0,0,0,,Then do you want me to move away?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.29,0:20:25.48,Default,S,0,0,0,,Move away...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.48,0:20:26.71,Default,S,0,0,0,,slowly.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.28,0:20:34.24,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Why isn't he more worried?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.57,0:20:38.80,Italics,S,0,0,0,,He killed without hesitation for those BIMs and chips.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:39.41,0:20:41.62,Italics,S,0,0,0,,And now he's just giving them up?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.13,0:20:44.32,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Something's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.32,0:20:45.44,Italics,S,0,0,0,,There's something I'm missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.29,0:20:47.96,Italics,S,0,0,0,,But what exactly is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.05,0:20:50.28,Italics,S,0,0,0,,A booby trap?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.81,0:20:53.58,Italics,S,0,0,0,,No, all his BIMs are there.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.58,0:20:55.86,Italics,S,0,0,0,,He didn't have time to place anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.52,0:21:02.03,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Could he have a remote control type?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.99,0:21:04.84,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That must be it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.41,0:21:06.89,Italics,S,0,0,0,,He set the trap...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.89,0:21:10.79,Italics,,0,0,0,,one using remote controlled BIMs, a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.49,0:21:15.67,Italics,S,0,0,0,,In other words, that trunk is surrounded by mines.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:16.41,0:21:18.59,Default,S,0,0,0,,Hey you, show me your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.15,0:21:21.50,Default,S,0,0,0,,Turn your palms toward me!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.50,0:21:22.54,Default,O,0,0,0,,Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.54,0:21:23.96,Default,S,0,0,0,,Just show me them!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.96,0:21:24.81,Default,S,0,0,0,,Be quick about it!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.95,0:21:27.72,Default,O,0,0,0,,Fine, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.37,0:21:33.51,Italics,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.51,0:21:34.94,Italics,S,0,0,0,,He must have them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.51,0:21:37.03,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Am I overthinking this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.66,0:21:39.03,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Is there some other way?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.03,0:21:40.71,Italics,S,0,0,0,,But what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.71,0:21:45.03,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Is he buying time while he waits for his buddies to come?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.72,0:21:48.44,Italics,S,0,0,0,,That would mean it's dangerous to delay.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.65,0:21:52.92,Italics,S,0,0,0,,I'll have to take a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.99,0:22:06.60,Italics,O,0,0,0,,You fell for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.60,0:22:07.85,Italics,O,0,0,0,,Die.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.65,0:22:12.36,Default,D,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.98,0:22:16.48,Default,H,0,0,0,,I-It can't be... Was Ryouta...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.07,0:22:22.22,Italics,O,0,0,0,,I won.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.16,0:22:28.16,Default,O,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.55,0:22:31.22,Italics,S,0,0,0,,Pretty smart.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.22,0:22:32.42,Italics,S,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.87,0:22:35.48,Italics,,0,0,0,,I won't lose at{\i0} BTOOOM!{\i1}.
