Dialogue: 0,0:24:10.14,0:24:12.55,Default,Preview,0,0,0,,Stay on the defensive, and you'll lose your chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:13.30,0:24:14.26,Default,Preview,0,0,0,,Ryouta...
